# ══════════════════════════════════════════
#  GET /recipes — list (CROC-015)
# ══════════════════════════════════════════

### ✅ 200 — anonymous list. Envelope: {recipes, page, limit, total, totalPages}.
### Only `approved: true` recipes for an anonymous caller.
GET http://localhost:{{$dotenv PORT}}/recipes?limit=5

###

### ✅ 200 — name search (case-insensitive substring). Finds the seeded recipe.
GET http://localhost:{{$dotenv PORT}}/recipes?q=http-test slow cooker

###

### ✅ 200 — filter by category (include is the default mode).
GET http://localhost:{{$dotenv PORT}}/recipes?categoryId={{recipeCategoryId1}}

###

### ✅ 200 — exclude that category instead.
GET http://localhost:{{$dotenv PORT}}/recipes?categoryId={{recipeCategoryId1}}&categoryMode=exclude

###

### ✅ 200 — filter by ingredient (the throwaway item).
GET http://localhost:{{$dotenv PORT}}/recipes?ingredientId={{itemId}}

###

### ✅ 200 — time range. The seeded stew is 360 min.
GET http://localhost:{{$dotenv PORT}}/recipes?minTime=300&maxTime=400

###

### ✅ 200 — pagination. limit clamps to [1,50]; page below 1 clamps to 1.
GET http://localhost:{{$dotenv PORT}}/recipes?page=1&limit=2

###

### ✅ 200 — authenticated (ADMIN): sees all recipes, approved or not.
GET http://localhost:{{$dotenv PORT}}/recipes?limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### ✅ 200 — ?mine=true with the ADMIN token: only recipes this account created.
GET http://localhost:{{$dotenv PORT}}/recipes?mine=true
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### ✅ 200 — ?mine=true anonymous: empty result, not 401.
GET http://localhost:{{$dotenv PORT}}/recipes?mine=true

###

### 🚫 400 invalid_request — malformed category UUID.
GET http://localhost:{{$dotenv PORT}}/recipes?categoryId=not-a-uuid

###

### 🚫 400 invalid_request — unknown categoryMode.
GET http://localhost:{{$dotenv PORT}}/recipes?categoryMode=sideways

###

### 🚫 400 invalid_request — non-numeric page.
GET http://localhost:{{$dotenv PORT}}/recipes?page=abc

###


# ══════════════════════════════════════════
#  GET /recipes/time-range — CROC-043
# ══════════════════════════════════════════

### ✅ 200 — {minTime, maxTime} across approved recipes only. No auth required.
GET http://localhost:{{$dotenv PORT}}/recipes/time-range

###


# ══════════════════════════════════════════
#  GET /recipes/:id — detail (CROC-015)
# ══════════════════════════════════════════

### ✅ 200 — the seeded recipe, anonymous. Fully hydrated: categories [{id,name}],
### ingredients with itemName / itemCategoryName / unitAbbreviation, description
### (null until CROC-016), createdByName, updatedAt.
GET http://localhost:{{$dotenv PORT}}/recipes/{{recipeId}}

###

### ✅ 200 — same recipe, authenticated.
GET http://localhost:{{$dotenv PORT}}/recipes/{{recipeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### 🚫 404 not_found — well-formed but nonexistent id (same response as a hidden recipe).
GET http://localhost:{{$dotenv PORT}}/recipes/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

###

### 🚫 400 invalid_request — malformed id.
GET http://localhost:{{$dotenv PORT}}/recipes/not-a-uuid

###


# ══════════════════════════════════════════
#  Favourites — CROC-018 (happy path)
# ══════════════════════════════════════════

### ✅ 200 — favourite the seeded recipe.
POST http://localhost:{{$dotenv PORT}}/recipes/{{recipeId}}/favourite
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### ✅ 200 — same call again: idempotent, still favourited, same message.
POST http://localhost:{{$dotenv PORT}}/recipes/{{recipeId}}/favourite
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### ✅ 200 — isFavourite now true on the detail endpoint.
GET http://localhost:{{$dotenv PORT}}/recipes/{{recipeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### ✅ 200 — shows up in the favourites list, isFavourite: true, same
### envelope shape as GET /recipes.
GET http://localhost:{{$dotenv PORT}}/recipes/favourites
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### ✅ 200 — pagination on the favourites list, same params as GET /recipes.
GET http://localhost:{{$dotenv PORT}}/recipes/favourites?page=1&limit=1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### ✅ 200 — unfavourite.
DELETE http://localhost:{{$dotenv PORT}}/recipes/{{recipeId}}/favourite
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### ✅ 200 — same call again: idempotent, still not favourited, same message.
DELETE http://localhost:{{$dotenv PORT}}/recipes/{{recipeId}}/favourite
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### ✅ 200 — isFavourite flips back to false on the detail endpoint.
GET http://localhost:{{$dotenv PORT}}/recipes/{{recipeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### ✅ 200 — no longer in the favourites list.
GET http://localhost:{{$dotenv PORT}}/recipes/favourites
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###


# ══════════════════════════════════════════
#  Favourites — CROC-018 (auth + validation)
# ══════════════════════════════════════════

### 🚫 401 — no token on favourite.
POST http://localhost:{{$dotenv PORT}}/recipes/{{recipeId}}/favourite

###

### 🚫 401 — no token on unfavourite.
DELETE http://localhost:{{$dotenv PORT}}/recipes/{{recipeId}}/favourite

###

### 🚫 401 — no token on the favourites list (unlike GET /recipes, no anonymous path).
GET http://localhost:{{$dotenv PORT}}/recipes/favourites

###

### 🚫 400 invalid_request — malformed id on favourite.
POST http://localhost:{{$dotenv PORT}}/recipes/not-a-uuid/favourite
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### 🚫 400 invalid_request — malformed id on unfavourite.
DELETE http://localhost:{{$dotenv PORT}}/recipes/not-a-uuid/favourite
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### 🚫 404 not_found — well-formed but nonexistent recipe on favourite.
POST http://localhost:{{$dotenv PORT}}/recipes/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/favourite
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### ✅ 200 — unfavouriting the same nonexistent id is NOT a 404 (decision 5:
### DELETE never re-checks visibility, so this affects 0 rows and succeeds).
DELETE http://localhost:{{$dotenv PORT}}/recipes/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/favourite
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###


# ══════════════════════════════════════════
#  Cleanup
# ══════════════════════════════════════════

### No DELETE /recipes endpoint until CROC-016, and the throwaway items
### can't be deleted through the API while recipe_ingredients rows point
### at them (RESTRICT). Run this SQL against the dev DB to reset:
###
###   DELETE FROM recipes WHERE name LIKE 'http-test%';
###   DELETE FROM items   WHERE name LIKE 'http-test-recipe-item%';
###
### (recipe_ingredients + recipe_categories_recipes cascade with the
### recipe rows.) A re-run from a clean DB then behaves identically.
###
### The favourites section above needs no cleanup of its own: the seeded
### recipe is unfavourited again before the run ends, leaving no residue
### (CROC-018's own roadmap note) — the 404-recipe DELETE just above never
### inserted a row to begin with.
